direction: down
title: GPTpatient modernization · Operations

// Retention and deletion lifecycle.
p01: Load customer text / audio retention policy { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
p02: Is text retention allowed and within retention period? { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
p03: Store transcript text events for restore and debrief { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
p04: Expire or omit transcript projection under policy { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
p05: DELETE /api/sessions/:sessionId { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
p06: Authenticate owner or authorized customer administrator { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
p07: Delete app-owned session · seed · facts · ledgers · transcript { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
p08: Request provider-context deletion where supported by policy { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
p09: Purge explicitly retained raw audio { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
p10: Record minimal deletion status if policy requires it { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
p01 -> p02
p02 -> p03: retain
p02 -> p04: disabled / expired
p05 -> p06 -> p07 -> p08 -> p09 -> p10

// Scenario termination, archive handoff, temporary-state expiry, and durable records.
b01: Scenario completes or is cancelled { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
b02: Worker records terminal state and unique archive job in PostgreSQL { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
b03: Idempotent worker builds archive from PostgreSQL and retained audio { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
b04: Verify private archive contents and metadata before publishing { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
b05: Authorize download until terminal time +72 hours; mint short-lived URL { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
b06: Set RedisJSON absolute expiry at terminal time +20 minutes { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
b07: Persist session · stats · provider usage · downloads · outcomes in PostgreSQL { shape: cylinder; style.fill: "#DDEFEA"; style.stroke: "#175A50"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
b08: Retry archive idempotently from PostgreSQL and retained audio source { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
b09: Deny downloads initiated after 72 hours; asynchronously delete expired artifact { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
b01 -> b02 -> b03 -> b04
b04 -> b05 -> b09
b02 -> b06
b02 -> b07
b03 -> b08: worker fails
b08 -> b03: retry

// Scale-out and latency controls.
q01: Begin with one API replica and PostgreSQL durable transactions { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q02: Require RedisJSON for live session state and Redis Streams for event handoff { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q03: Measure cross-replica coordination and websocket needs { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q04: Add extra Redis pub/sub and rate-limit state only when measured { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q05: Reconcile absolute terminal +20-minute expiry through PostgreSQL outbox { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q06: PostgreSQL stores durable clinical ledger · client records · metrics { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q07: Bound setup queue · concurrency · timeout · retries { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q08: Reserve capacity for interactive turns { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q09: Bound post-session scoring separately { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q10: Back-pressure requests and serialize each session { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q11: Scale stateless API across independent customer sessions { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q12: Add worker pool only if setup / scoring harms measured turn latency { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q13: Keep one modular API when no measured interference exists { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q14: Commit active state · reply · retry key · event in one Redis round trip { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q15: Dedicated workers persist events · metrics · archives asynchronously { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q16: Never await side work; keep nonblocking handoff under 5 milliseconds { shape: diamond; style.fill: "#FFF0C2"; style.stroke: "#77520A"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
q01 -> q02 -> q03
q03 -> q04: measured cross-replica need
q04 -> q05
q03 -> q13: one API replica is sufficient
q13 -> q05 -> q06
q04 -> q06
q07 -> q08 -> q09 -> q10 -> q11 -> q12
q12 -> q04: measured isolation need
q12 -> q13: no interference
q02 -> q14 -> q15 -> q16

// Operational observability and performance evidence.
z01: Timestamp browser capture and transcript display { shape: rectangle; style.fill: "#E8F0FC"; style.stroke: "#244C78"; style.font-color: "#14243A"; style.font-size: 68; style.stroke-width: 2 }
